  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I'm On Fire (Jim James solo) (Bruce Springsteen cover)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-03-18.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 7 songs; 35 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Crowd was small, consisting of a few fanatics and local bar patrons [1]\n- A DJ played records at 1 AM, ending the night early [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-03-18.aud.flac16**: taped by George \"Low Dog\" S.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Audio transferred from CD-R to FLAC using EAC and Traders Little Helper [1]",
